    "created_at": "2023-09-16T00:49:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-16T00:49:42Z",
    "body": "And it's set here: https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#:~:text=If%20request%E2%80%99s%20origin%20is%20%22client%22%2C%20then%20set%20request%E2%80%99s%20origin%20to%20request%E2%80%99s%20client%E2%80%99s%20origin.\n\nAnd the request's origin is used in a number of checks, and presumably for purposes of determining CORS same-origin as well.",
