    "created_at": "2023-09-20T15:25:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-20T15:25:32Z",
    "body": "For what it's worth, I realized that one of the thing that was confusing me was that when I searched through the fetch spec, the definitions of \"basic filtered response\", \"CORS filtered response\", etc.,  at https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-filtered-response-basic are actually definitions that are *writing* the response type, whereas reading the definitions I read the definitions as *reading* the response type.  I wonder if the terms should actually be algorithms like \"create a basic filtered response\" etc.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
